NOTE ON THE DATA

All data produced by this software is synthetic and generated locally. The
project does not read, copy, transform or derive any production data, and it
must not be modified to do so. The failure patterns described in
`src/ailab_ops/datagen/faults.yaml` are abstracted from generally-known
distributed-systems failure modes; the entities, identifiers, logs and metrics
are invented.
